OL,3,GNEWSAInadequate care service 'let down'
OL,4,Aresidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople supported by a care service were
OL,7,F"let down" as standards declined
OL,8,Fsharply over recent years, inspectors
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,11,FBracknell-based Choice Supported Living
OL,12,F- East was inspected by the Care
OL,13,FQuality Commission (CQC) in August
OL,14,Fafter people contacted it with
OL,15,Fsafeguarding concerns.
OL,17,FThe provider's overall rating was
OL,18,Fdowngraded to inadequate from good,
OL,19,Fwhich it received following a previous
OL,20,Fvisit in 2020.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
