OL,3,GNEWSAInadequate care service 'let down'
OL,4,Aresidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Choice Care, which
OL,7,Foperates the service, acknowledged it
OL,8,F"could have done better in some areas"
OL,9,Fbut that it has taken targeted action
OL,10,Fto ensure improvements have been made.
